(6928928, 1044309, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice fit to the challenge. I like the rich, dark tones in the wood in contrast with the bright fruit. Did you consider a square crop? I think that would have made the photo a little stronger.</td>', 'Nice fit to the challenge. I like the rich, dark tones in the wood in contrast with the bright fruit. Did you consider a square crop? I think that would have made the photo a little stronger.', '2012-12-10 09:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6928929, 1044572, 10785, '<td valign="top">Wonderful viewpoint for this challenge. I think the composition would have been made stronger with a better use of the rule of thirds. Another possibility could have been to put her dead center with a square crop.</td>', 'Wonderful viewpoint for this challenge. I think the composition would have been made stronger with a better use of the rule of thirds. Another possibility could have been to put her dead center with a square crop.', '2012-12-10 09:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6928930, 1044669, 10785, '<td valign="top">Super cute little girl! Her big brown almond eyes are so beautiful! Here I think the center part of the shot is a bit overexposed. I think you could have brought that down a quarter stop or a half. I love her cute outfit and Ugg Boots!</td>', 'Super cute little girl! Her big brown almond eyes are so beautiful! Here I think the center part of the shot is a bit overexposed. I think you could have brought that down a quarter stop or a half. I love her cute outfit and Ugg Boots!', '2012-12-10 09:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6928932, 1044736, 10785, '<td valign="top">Not only blanched, totally cooked. I know you were going for minimal details, but I think this is very overexposed and even in a high key photo there has to be some contrast and detail. I think this is a little low in contrast and detail.</td>', 'Not only blanched, totally cooked. I know you were going for minimal details, but I think this is very overexposed and even in a high key photo there has to be some contrast and detail. I think this is a little low in contrast and detail.', '2012-12-10 09:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
