(6934261, 1044603, 138630, '<td valign="top">Once through with preliminary votes, always on the low side for me to give me room to bump, and this is standing out there all alone with a 9 that will be a 10 as soon as I finish this comment.  Fits the challenge - love the glimpse of rooftops and the street below that lets me know he''s up a level and he''s looking down which is perfect.  And I love the image quite aside from the challenge: beautiful light and subdued tones, great patterns, a wonderfully lonely feel that is nostalgic but not necessarily sad.  Should be the winner, IMO.</td>', 'Once through with preliminary votes, always on the low side for me to give me room to bump, and this is standing out there all alone with a 9 that will be a 10 as soon as I finish this comment.  Fits the challenge - love the glimpse of rooftops and the street below that lets me know he''s up a level and he''s looking down which is perfect.  And I love the image quite aside from the challenge: beautiful light and subdued tones, great patterns, a wonderfully lonely feel that is nostalgic but not necessarily sad.  Should be the winner, IMO.', '2012-12-16 10:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6934337, 1044570, 60173, '<td valign="top">If that''s not perfection, I''m not sure what is. <br/> <br/>I love that the line of her leg continues with the end of the cloth at the bottom. That''s a very small window of time to capture, and you did it perfectly. Such strong lines overall.</td>', 'If that''s not perfection, I''m not sure what is.  I love that the line of her leg continues with the end of the cloth at the bottom. That''s a very small window of time to capture, and you did it perfectly. Such strong lines overall.', '2012-12-16 12:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
